# Temporal MCP

Load [`docs/agents/mcp/temporal.md`](docs/agents/mcp/temporal.md).

Call `temporal` only if `jarvis project show <name> --json` includes
`temporal` in `project.mcp`. If the list is missing or empty, skip Temporal.
Do not ask the user to connect a cluster.

Host is `TEMPORAL_HOST` as `host:port`. Namespace is `TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE`.
Do not put keys or hosts in git.

Prefer `list_workflows`, `describe_workflow`, and history tools.
Do not call start, signal, cancel, terminate, or batch tools unless the
user names the workflow and asks to change it.
